Also at <=560: hide the "descubiertos" word? The `.stat span` is small text. Let's keep but shrink.

Let me compute: at 390 we need: logo 33 + gap + title + stats + tools(249).
Tools = 249px, that's a lot. Let me reduce the tools on mobile: hide the "💡" and "🔊" buttons on very small screens? Better: keep all but make them smaller (padding 8px→7px, font 12.5→12). Or reduce to icon-only (already icon-only for some).

Buttons widths at mobile: 39,38,38,39,30,35 = 219 + 5 gaps*6=30 → 249. 

Available: 390 - 18(padding) = 372. tools 249 → leaves 123 for brand+stats. Logo 33 + stats ~84 = 117. So the title has ~0 space. 

